  "stgbExoPlayerDesc": "Decodes straight into a surface, so 4K arrives without being copied out of the decoder first. On a 2 GB television that is the difference between 904 ms and over 1,900 ms of delay, and between no dropped frames and one and a half a second. Subtitles are rendered by Android, so the styling options below do not apply here.",
